  "statement": "In the multiplication problem below \\(A,\\) \\(B,\\) \\(C,\\) \\(D\\) are different digits. What is \\(A+B?\\) \\[ \\begin{array}{cccc}& A & B & A\\\\ \\times & & C & D\\\\ \\hline C & D & C & D\\\\ \\end{array} \\]",
